{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How  many  integers  between  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />  and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1216dd3855e1bb88b6136b4ce49c58b57747417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />,  inclusive,  are  perfect  squares?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/a/5aa6c728fece4dd4e8947aac263f73c0f035206f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }37\\qquad \\text{(B) }38\\qquad \\text{(C) }39\\qquad \\text{(D) }40\\qquad \\text{(E) }41\\qquad \\text{(F) }42\\qquad \\text{(G) }43\\qquad \\text{(H) }44\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"622\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/0/7c04cd57651c2860f74b8655a7ffb36781a4d4a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(I) }45\\qquad \\text{(J) }46\\qquad \\text{(K) }47\\qquad \\text{(L) }48\\qquad \\text{(M) }49\\qquad \\text{(N) }50\\qquad \\text{(O) }\\text{none of the above}\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"644\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d911a9fd4ef5afaf0c230e211d19411a0998862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1600 &lt; 2006 &lt; 2500$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"156\" height=\"13\" />, so the number of perfect squares must be around 40 to 50.  With some trial and error, we found that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/c/9dc3df5b561e3a539b0bf3e7fddc9748f1c0826a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44^2 = 1936$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/9/779f216c74ee287256d39b586d92171189ae882e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45^2 = 2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, so the perfect squares between 1 and 2006 are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/5572121a042724deac8ccaa2446025ed0aaac01c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^2, 2^2, 3^2, \\cdots 44^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />.  There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144fae31fe5aac47a15cb71a7d2456ce70d67803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(H) } 44}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"66\" height=\"28\" /> integers in the set.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iT